  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> 님께서\n일부러 저를 보러 와 주시다니!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n이 감동과 감사의 마음을\n포켓몬 승부로 표현해 드리겠어요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010000000020B2D8AED8C11C000AC77CBD80B7EC0020C800B97C0020BCF4B7EC0020C6400020C8FCC2DCB2E4B2C8002100100001BE01000AC7740020AC10B3D9ACFC0020AC10C0ACC7580020B9C8C74CC744000AD3ECCF13BAAC0020C2B9BD80B85C0020D45CD604D5740020B4DCB9ACACA0C5B4C694002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "유카리 님이 아니라\n나에게 말을 건 것은 높이 사 주겠어.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n그럼, 승부를 시작할까!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C720CE74B9AC0020B2D8C7740020C544B2C8B77C000AB098C5D0AC8C0020B9D0C7440020AC740020AC83C7400020B192C7740020C0AC0020C8FCACA0C5B4002E00100001BE00000AADF8B7FC002C0020C2B9BD80B97C0020C2DCC791D560AE4C002100100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "잠깐! 그쪽이 둘이라면\n제가 <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0002> 돕겠어요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7A0AE5000210020ADF8CABDC7740020B458C774B77CBA74000AC81CAC000020001000020100000000100002190000020020B3D5ACA0C5B4C6940021001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>, 준비됐으면\n바로 포켓몬 승부를 시작하자!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000002C0020C900BE44B410C73CBA74000ABC14B85C0020D3ECCF13BAAC0020C2B9BD80B97C0020C2DCC791D558C7900021001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "좋아!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C88BC54400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "잠깐만",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7A0AE50B9CC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "갑작스러워서\n뭐가 뭔지 잘 모르겠지?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n마음이 정리되면\nMSBC 사람들에게 말을 걸어 줘.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC11C791C2A4B7ECC6CCC11C000ABB50AC000020BB54C9C00020C7980020BAA8B974ACA0C9C0003F00100001BE01000AB9C8C74CC7740020C815B9ACB418BA74000A004D0053004200430020C0ACB78CB4E4C5D0AC8C0020B9D0C7440020AC78C5B40020C918002E001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "MSBC의 둘에게\n우리 MZ단이 얼마나 대단한지 보여 주자!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D005300420043C7580020B458C5D0AC8C000AC6B0B9AC0020004D005AB2E8C7740020C5BCB9C8B0980020B300B2E8D55CC9C00020BCF4C5EC0020C8FCC7900021001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> 님,\n저와 승부해 주세요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010000000020B2D8002C000AC800C6400020C2B9BD80D5740020C8FCC138C694002E00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나와 승부할 거지?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098C6400020C2B9BD80D5600020AC70C9C0003F00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "승부해요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2B9BD80D574C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "기다려 주세요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE30B2E4B8240020C8FCC138C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저를 애태우시다니...\n좋은 답변을 기다리고 있겠어요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800B97C0020C560D0DCC6B0C2DCB2E4B2C8002E002E002E000AC88BC7400020B2F5BCC0C7440020AE30B2E4B9ACACE00020C788ACA0C5B4C694002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이쪽엔 시온이 있어요.\n다시 말해 저희의 승리라는 거예요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774CABDC5D40020C2DCC628C7740020C788C5B4C694002E000AB2E4C2DC0020B9D0D5740020C800D76CC7580020C2B9B9ACB77CB2940020AC70C608C694002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "너와의 싸움은 정해진 운명!\n피하려 해 봤자 소용없다고.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B108C640C7580020C2F8C6C0C7400020C815D574C9C40020C6B4BA850021000AD53CD558B8240020D5740020BD24C7900020C18CC6A9C5C6B2E4ACE0002E00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "좋아!\n유카리 님보다 크게 활약해 주겠어!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C88BC5440021000AC720CE74B9AC0020B2D8BCF4B2E40020D06CAC8C0020D65CC57DD5740020C8FCACA0C5B4002100100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "싸울 준비가 됐으면\nMSBC 사람들에게 말을 걸어 줘.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2F8C6B80020C900BE44AC000020B410C73CBA74000A004D0053004200430020C0ACB78CB4E4C5D0AC8C0020B9D0C7440020AC78C5B40020C918002E001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "모두를 이끄는 것이\n우리 셀럽의 사명이에요, 픽시!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BAA8B450B97C0020C774B044B2940020AC83C774000AC6B0B9AC0020C140B7FDC7580020C0ACBA85C774C5D0C694002C0020D53DC2DC002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "우리의 비장의 카드!\n드래캄! 메가진화로 날뛰어 보자고!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C6B0B9ACC7580020BE44C7A5C7580020CE74B4DC0021000AB4DCB798CE8400210020BA54AC00C9C4D654B85C0020B0A0B6F0C5B40020BCF4C790ACE0002100100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아쿠스타!\n우리의 멋진 스텝을 보여 주자!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544CFE0C2A4D0C00021000AC6B0B9ACC7580020BA4BC9C40020C2A4D15DC7440020BCF4C5EC0020C8FCC7900021001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "와~! 이겼다!\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>, 우리가 이겼어!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C640007E00210020C774ACBCB2E40021000A0010000201000000002C0020C6B0B9ACAC000020C774ACBCC5B40021001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> 님도 대단했지만\n루디 님의 아쿠스타도 움직임이 대단했어요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010000000020B2D8B3C40020B300B2E8D588C9C0B9CC000AB8E8B5140020B2D8C7580020C544CFE0C2A4D0C0B3C40020C6C0C9C1C784C7740020B300B2E8D588C5B4C694002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "유카리 님.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C720CE74B9AC0020B2D8002E00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "댄스를 하는 사람은\n코어가 단련되어 있어서 몸을 잘 다루고<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n격투기에도 소질이 있습니다.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n이것이 트레이너로서의 역량과\n파트너 포켓몬의 움직임으로 이어지는 거죠.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이참에 유카리 님께서도\n댄스 특훈을 해 보는 건 어떠신지...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774CC38C5D00020C720CE74B9AC0020B2D8AED8C11CB3C4000AB304C2A40020D2B9D6C8C7440020D5740020BCF4B2940020AC740020C5B4B5A0C2E0C9C0002E002E002E00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "너...\n내가 박치인 걸 알면서도 권하는 거야?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 2024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B108002E002E002E000AB0B4AC000020BC15CE58C7780020AC780020C54CBA74C11CB3C40020AD8CD558B2940020AC70C57C003F00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그러시다면\n제가 가르쳐 드릴게요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 2088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7ECC2DCB2E4BA74000AC81CAC000020AC00B974CCD00020B4DCB9B4AC8CC6940021001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "...감사해요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "002E002E002EAC10C0ACD574C694002E00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> 님,\n저를 이긴 증표로 이걸 드리겠어요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010000000020B2D8002C000AC800B97C0020C774AE340020C99DD45CB85C0020C774AC780020B4DCB9ACACA0C5B4C694002E00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0001>\n유카리 코디 원피스를 손에 넣었다!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010000000010000219000001000AC720CE74B9AC0020CF54B5140020C6D0D53CC2A4B97C0020C190C5D00020B123C5C8B2E400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0004> 유카리 씨가 같은 옷을!?\n이차원 미르에서는 뭐든 일어날 수 있구나!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000000100002190000040020C720CE74B9AC0020C528AC000020AC19C7400020C637C7440021003F000AC774CC28C6D00020BBF8B974C5D0C11CB2940020BB50B4E00020C77CC5B4B0A00020C2180020C788AD6CB0980021001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이차원의 유카리 씨가\n박치인 걸 신경 쓰고 있다는 건<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n현실의 유카리 씨도 마찬가지라는 걸까?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774CC28C6D0C7580020C720CE74B9AC0020C528AC00000ABC15CE58C7780020AC780020C2E0ACBD0020C4F0ACE00020C788B2E4B2940020AC7400100001BE00000AD604C2E4C7580020C720CE74B9AC0020C528B3C40020B9C8CC2CAC00C9C0B77CB2940020AC78AE4C003F001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "사교댄스도\n되도록 피해 왔었는데...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0ACAD50B304C2A4B3C4000AB418B3C4B85D0020D53CD5740020C654C5C8B294B370002E002E002E00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저는 댄스에도 소양이 있으니\n유카리 님만 괜찮으시다면<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n제가 가르쳐 드릴 수 있습니다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800B2940020B304C2A4C5D0B3C40020C18CC591C7740020C788C73CB2C8000AC720CE74B9AC0020B2D8B9CC0020AD1CCC2EC73CC2DCB2E4BA7400100001BE00000AC81CAC000020AC00B974CCD00020B4DCB9B40020C2180020C788C2B5B2C8B2E4002E00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    }
  ],
